function gb.sandShift(YPb,ZPb)
local _Pb=math.floor((tonumber(ZPb)or 0)*gb.BINS+1e-6)+1
if not YPb or _Pb<=1 or _Pb>gb.BINS then
return YPb
end
local function aQb(bQb)
local cQb
for dQb=1,gb.BINS do
if bQb[dQb]then
cQb=dQb
break
end
end
if not cQb or cQb>=_Pb then
return bQb,false
end
local eQb,fQb={},_Pb-cQb
for gQb=1,gb.BINS do
if bQb[gQb]then
eQb[math.min(gb.BINS,gQb+fQb)]=true
end
end
return eQb,true
end
local hQb,iQb=aQb(YPb)
if YPb.lanes then
local jQb,kQb={},false
for lQb,mQb in pairs(YPb.lanes)do
local nQb,oQb=aQb(mQb)
jQb[lQb]=nQb
kQb=kQb or oQb
end
if not iQb and not kQb then
return YPb
end
if not iQb then
hQb={}
for pQb=1,gb.BINS do
hQb[pQb]=YPb[pQb]
end
end
hQb.lanes=jQb
end
return hQb
end
function gb.teamFrom(qQb,rQb)
local sQb={}
local tQb=P.maps[rQb]or P.maps[tostring(rQb):match(xre[2510])or xre[993]]
local uQb=not(tQb and tQb.hill==false)
for vQb,wQb in ipairs(qQb)do
local xQb=N.Units[wQb.unit_id]
local yQb=xQb and V.rows(wQb.unit_id)
if yQb then
table.insert(sQb,{u=wQb,id=wQb.unit_id,data=xQb,rows=yQb,cap=V.cap(wQb),farm=V.isFarm(wQb.unit_id),placeable=(not xQb.hill_unit)or uQb})
end
end
return sQb
end
gb.UNIT_SPLIT,gb.UNIT_MIN,gb.UNIT_MAX,gb.UNIT_SHARE_MIN=0.5,0.2,5,0.02
function gb.unitK(zQb,AQb,BQb)
local CQb=BQb and xre[3778]or xre[3779]
local DQb=zQb[CQb]
if not DQb then
DQb={}
zQb[CQb]=DQb
end
local EQb=DQb[AQb.id]
if EQb==nil then
local FQb=BQb and type(zQb.unitKBox)==xre[2074]and zQb.unitKBox[AQb.id]or nil
if not(type(FQb)==xre[2074]and tonumber(FQb.k))then
FQb=type(zQb.unitK)==xre[2074]and zQb.unitK[AQb.id]or nil
end
EQb=(type(FQb)==xre[2074]and tonumber(FQb.k)and gb.ukNow(FQb,AQb.id))or(not zQb.fbVoid and gb.unitHive(zQb.key,AQb.id))or 1
DQb[AQb.id]=EQb
end
return EQb
end
function gb.ukNow(GQb,HQb)
local IQb,JQb=tonumber(GQb.k)or 1,tonumber(GQb.nu)
if not JQb or JQb<=0 then
return IQb
end
return U.clamp(IQb*JQb/math.max(0.01,V.nudge(HQb)),gb.UNIT_MIN,gb.UNIT_MAX)
end
function gb.unitHive(KQb,LQb)
local MQb,NQb=pcall(db.hive)
for OQb,PQb in ipairs({xre[3780],xre[3781]})do
local QQb=MQb and NQb and type(NQb[PQb])==xre[2074]and NQb[PQb][tostring(KQb)]or nil
local RQb=type(QQb)==xre[2074]and QQb[LQb]or nil
if type(RQb)==xre[2074]and tonumber(RQb[1])and(tonumber(RQb[2])or 0)>=2 then
return U.clamp(tonumber(RQb[1])*(PQb==xre[3781]and V.footK(LQb)or 1),gb.UNIT_MIN,gb.UNIT_MAX)
end
end
return nil
end
function gb.footMove()
local SQb=tonumber(P.footV)or 0
if SQb>=2 then
return
end
if SQb<1 then
gb.footMove1()
end
local TQb,UQb=0,{}
for VQb,WQb in pairs(P.simCal or{})do
for XQb,YQb in ipairs({xre[3782],xre[3783]})do
for ZQb,_Qb in pairs(type(WQb)==xre[2074]and type(WQb[YQb])==xre[2074]and WQb[YQb]or{})do
local aRb=V.DRONES[ZQb]
if type(_Qb)==xre[2074]and tonumber(_Qb.k)and aRb and tonumber(aRb.moveK)then
_Qb.nu=(tonumber(_Qb.nu)or V.nudge(ZQb))/aRb.moveK
TQb=TQb+1
UQb[ZQb]=true
end
end
end
end
P.footV=2
if TQb>0 then
local bRb={}
for cRb in pairs(UQb)do
table.insert(bRb,string.format(xre[3784],V.name(cRb),V.DRONES[cRb].moveK))
end
F.log(1,xre[2185],string.format(xre[3785],table.concat(bRb,xre[2187]),TQb))
end
F.saveSoon()
end
function gb.footMove1()
local dRb={}
local function eRb(fRb)
if dRb[fRb]==nil then
local gRb,hRb=0,0
local iRb=P.learn[fRb]
if iRb and tonumber(iRb.n)and iRb.n>=1 then
local jRb=tonumber(iRb.eff)or 1
if(tonumber(iRb.v)or 0)<3 then
jRb=jRb*V.effRescale(fRb)
end
if(tonumber(iRb.v)or 0)<4 then
jRb=jRb*V.secRescale(fRb)
end
gRb,hRb=math.log(math.max(0.01,jRb))*iRb.n,iRb.n
end
local kRb,lRb=V.hiveEff(fRb,true)
if kRb then
gRb,hRb=gRb+math.log(math.max(0.01,kRb))*lRb,hRb+lRb
end
dRb[fRb]=V.nudgeFrom(gRb,hRb)
end
return dRb[fRb]
end
local mRb=0
for nRb,oRb in pairs(P.simCal or{})do
for pRb,qRb in ipairs({xre[3782],xre[3783]})do
for rRb,sRb in pairs(type(oRb)==xre[2074]and type(oRb[qRb])==xre[2074]and oRb[qRb]or{})do
if type(sRb)==xre[2074]and tonumber(sRb.k)and not tonumber(sRb.nu)then
sRb.nu=eRb(rRb)
mRb=mRb+1
end
end
end
end
for tRb in pairs(P.learn or{})do
eRb(tRb)
end
for uRb,vRb in pairs(P.learn or{})do
if type(vRb)==xre[2074]then
V.learnUp(uRb,vRb)
end
end
P.footV=1
local wRb={}
for xRb,yRb in pairs(dRb)do
local zRb=V.nudge(xRb)
if math.abs(zRb/yRb-1)>=0.05 then
table.insert(wRb,{d=math.abs(math.log(zRb/yRb)),t=string.format(xre[3786],V.name(xRb),yRb,zRb)})
end
end
table.sort(wRb,function(ARb,BRb)
return ARb.d>BRb.d
end)
local CRb={}
for DRb,ERb in ipairs(wRb)do
if DRb<=8 then
table.insert(CRb,ERb.t)
end
end
F.log(1,xre[2185],string.format(xre[3787],#CRb>0 and(xre[2417]..table.concat(CRb,xre[2450]))or xre[993],mRb))
F.saveSoon()
end
function gb.mapK(FRb,GRb)
local HRb=FRb._mk
if not HRb then
HRb={}
FRb._mk=HRb
end
local IRb=HRb[GRb.id]
if IRb==nil then
local JRb,KRb=pcall(V.mapNudge,GRb.id,FRb.map,FRb.mapSig)
IRb=JRb and tonumber(KRb)or 1
HRb[GRb.id]=IRb
end
return IRb
end
function gb.sig(LRb)
local MRb={}
for NRb,ORb in ipairs(LRb)do
table.insert(MRb,tostring(ORb.unit_id))
end
table.sort(MRb)
return table.concat(MRb,xre[2938])
end
gb.WALK_STUDS=1.9
function gb.boxBins(PRb,QRb,RRb)
local SRb=2*(QRb or 0)*(tonumber(PRb.walk)or gb.PRIOR.walk)/gb.WALK_STUDS
return math.max(1,math.min(RRb,math.floor(SRb*gb.BINS+0.5)))
end
gb._holds,gb._holdsFrom={},{}
function gb.holds(TRb)
local URb=gb._holds[TRb]
if URb==nil then
URb=false
local VRb,WRb=pcall(V.toggleOf,TRb)
if VRb and WRb then
URb,gb._holdsFrom[TRb]=true,tonumber(WRb.from)or 1
end
local XRb=not URb and V.rows(TRb)
for YRb=0,XRb and XRb.max or-1 do
local ZRb=XRb[YRb]
local _Rb,aSb=false,nil
if ZRb then
_Rb,aSb=pcall(V.attackInfo,ZRb.atk,ZRb.range)
end
if _Rb and aSb and((aSb.stun or 0)>0 or(aSb.slowTime or 0)>0)then
URb,gb._holdsFrom[TRb]=true,YRb
break
end
end
gb._holds[TRb]=URb
end
return URb,gb._holdsFrom[TRb]
end
gb.GALE_SLOW=0.3
gb.DMG_BANDS={5,10,15,20,30,45,math.huge}
gb.DMG_STEP,gb.DMG_MIN,gb.DMG_MAX,gb.DMG_FLOOR=0.35,0.1,3,1
function gb.dmgBand(bSb)
for cSb,dSb in ipairs(gb.DMG_BANDS)do
if bSb<=dSb then
return cSb
end
end
return#gb.DMG_BANDS
end
function gb.dmgBandName(eSb)
local fSb=gb.DMG_BANDS[eSb]
local gSb=eSb==1 and 1 or gb.DMG_BANDS[eSb-1]+1
return fSb==math.huge and(gSb..xre[2389])or(gSb..xre[2100]..fSb)
end
gb.DMG_PRIOR_RUNS=6
function gb.dmgAll()
local hSb=gb._dmgAll
if hSb and os.clock()-hSb.t<60 then
return hSb.v
end
local iSb,jSb={},{}
for kSb,lSb in pairs(P.simCal)do
local mSb=kSb~=xre[2101]and not tostring(kSb):find(xre[3764],1,true)and type(lSb)==xre[2074]and type(lSb.dmgK)==xre[2074]and lSb.dmgK or nil
for nSb=1,#gb.DMG_BANDS do
local oSb=mSb and mSb[tostring(nSb)]
local pSb,qSb=type(oSb)==xre[2074]and tonumber(oSb.k)or nil,type(oSb)==xre[2074]and tonumber(oSb.n)or 0
if pSb and pSb>0 and qSb>0 then
iSb[nSb]=(iSb[nSb]or 0)+qSb*math.log(pSb)
jSb[nSb]=(jSb[nSb]or 0)+qSb
end
end
end
local rSb={}
for sSb,tSb in pairs(iSb)do
rSb[tostring(sSb)]={k=math.exp(tSb/(jSb[sSb]+gb.DMG_PRIOR_RUNS)),n=0}
end
gb._dmgAll={t=os.clock(),v=rSb}
return rSb
end
function gb.dmgHive(uSb)
local vSb,wSb=pcall(db.hive)
local xSb=vSb and wSb and type(wSb.dmg)==xre[2074]and wSb.dmg[tostring(uSb)]or nil
if type(xSb)~=xre[2074]then
return nil
end
local ySb={}
for zSb,ASb in pairs(xSb)do
if type(ASb)==xre[2074]and tonumber(ASb[1])and((tonumber(ASb[2])or 0)>=2 or(tonumber(ASb[3])or 0)>=4)then
ySb[tostring(zSb)]={k=U.clamp(tonumber(ASb[1]),gb.DMG_MIN,gb.DMG_MAX),n=0,hive=true}
end
end
return next(ySb)and ySb or nil
end
function gb.dmgK(BSb,CSb)
local DSb=BSb._dk
if not DSb then
DSb={}
BSb._dk=DSb
end
local ESb=DSb[CSb]
if ESb then
return ESb
end
ESb=1
local FSb=BSb.dmgK
if type(FSb)~=xre[2074]or next(FSb)==nil then
FSb=(not BSb.fbVoid and gb.dmgHive(BSb.key))or gb.dmgAll()
end
if type(FSb)==xre[2074]then
local GSb,HSb=gb.dmgBand(math.max(1,CSb)),math.huge
for ISb=1,#gb.DMG_BANDS do
local JSb=FSb[tostring(ISb)]
local KSb=type(JSb)==xre[2074]and tonumber(JSb.k)or nil
if KSb and math.abs(ISb-GSb)<HSb then
ESb,HSb=KSb,math.abs(ISb-GSb)
end
end
end
ESb=ESb*(tonumber(BSb.dmgMul)or 1)
DSb[CSb]=ESb
return ESb
end
gb.DMG_SOLVE_LO,gb.DMG_SOLVE_HI,gb.DMG_SOLVE_TRIES=0.1,3,6
function gb.dmgSolve(LSb,MSb,NSb,OSb,PSb)
local function QSb(RSb)
local SSb=table.clone(LSb)
SSb.dmgMul,SSb._dk=RSb,nil
local TSb,USb=pcall(gb.runRaw,SSb,MSb,NSb)
if not(TSb and type(USb)==xre[2074])then
return nil
end
if PSb then
return USb.won and 1 or-1
end
if USb.won then
return 1
end
return(tonumber(USb.wave)or 0)-OSb
end
local VSb,WSb=math.log(gb.DMG_SOLVE_LO),math.log(gb.DMG_SOLVE_HI)
local XSb=QSb(gb.DMG_SOLVE_LO)
if not XSb then
return nil
end
if XSb>=0 then
return gb.DMG_SOLVE_LO
end
local YSb=QSb(gb.DMG_SOLVE_HI)
if not YSb then
return nil
end
if YSb<0 then
return gb.DMG_SOLVE_HI
end
for ZSb=1,gb.DMG_SOLVE_TRIES do
task.wait()
local _Sb=(VSb+WSb)/2
local aTb=QSb(math.exp(_Sb))
if not aTb then
return nil
end
if aTb>=0 then
WSb=_Sb
else
VSb=_Sb
end
end
return math.exp(WSb)
end
function gb.mid(bTb)
local cTb= #bTb
if cTb==0 then
return nil
end
if cTb%2==1 then
return bTb[(cTb+1)/2]
end
return(bTb[cTb/2]+bTb[cTb/2+1])/2
end
function gb.dmgWords(dTb)
local eTb={}
for fTb=1,#gb.DMG_BANDS do
local gTb=type(dTb)==xre[2074]and dTb[tostring(fTb)]or nil
if type(gTb)==xre[2074]and tonumber(gTb.k)then
table.insert(eTb,string.format(xre[3788],gb.dmgBandName(fTb),tonumber(gTb.k)))
end
end
return table.concat(eTb,xre[2187])
end
function gb.dmgApply(hTb,iTb,jTb,kTb,lTb,mTb,nTb,oTb,pTb)
local function qTb(rTb,sTb)
return type(rTb)==xre[2074]and tonumber(rTb[sTb]or rTb[tostring(sTb)])or nil
end
local tTb=gb.cal(hTb)
local uTb=pTb and xre[3783]or xre[3782]
local vTb={}
for wTb,xTb in pairs(type(tTb.dmgK)==xre[2074]and tTb.dmgK or{})do
vTb[wTb]=xTb
end
local yTb=gb.dmgBand(math.max(1,mTb))
for zTb=6,mTb do
local ATb,BTb=qTb(nTb,zTb)or 0,qTb(oTb,zTb)or 0
local CTb=0
for DTb,ETb in ipairs((gb.wave(iTb,zTb)))do
CTb=CTb+(tonumber(ETb.hp)or 0)+(tonumber(ETb.bar)or 0)
end
if CTb>0 and math.max(ATb,BTb)>gb.DMG_FLOOR*CTb then
yTb=gb.dmgBand(zTb)
break
end
end
local function FTb(GTb)
local HTb=vTb[tostring(GTb)]
if type(HTb)==xre[2074]and(tonumber(HTb.n)or 0)>0 then
return tonumber(HTb.n)
end
local ITb,JTb=0,math.huge
for KTb=1,#gb.DMG_BANDS do
local LTb=vTb[tostring(KTb)]
if type(LTb)==xre[2074]and tonumber(LTb.k)and(tonumber(LTb.n)or 0)>0 and math.abs(KTb-GTb)<JTb then
ITb,JTb=tonumber(LTb.n),math.abs(KTb-GTb)
end
end
return ITb
end
local MTb=gb.dmgBand(math.max(1,mTb))
local NTb={}
for OTb=1,MTb do
NTb[OTb]=FTb(OTb)
end
local PTb={}
local QTb=lTb^(1-gb.UNIT_SPLIT)
for RTb=1,MTb do
local STb=RTb==1 and 1 or gb.DMG_BANDS[RTb-1]+1
local TTb=type(vTb[tostring(RTb)])==xre[2074]and vTb[tostring(RTb)]or nil
local UTb=(TTb and tonumber(TTb.k))or gb.dmgK(iTb,STb)
local VTb=NTb[RTb]
if RTb<yTb then
if not TTb then
vTb[tostring(RTb)]={k=UTb,n=0,at=os.time(),src=xre[3789]}
end
else
local WTb=VTb==0 and 1 or math.max(0.5,1/(VTb+1))
local XTb=U.clamp(UTb*QTb^WTb,gb.DMG_MIN,gb.DMG_MAX)
vTb[tostring(RTb)]={k=XTb,n=VTb+1,at=os.time(),src=xre[2102]}
table.insert(PTb,string.format(xre[3790],gb.dmgBandName(RTb),XTb,UTb))
end
end
local YTb=table.clone(iTb)
YTb.dmgMul,YTb._dk=lTb,nil
local ZTb={}
for _Tb,aUb in pairs(kTb or{})do
ZTb[_Tb]=aUb
end
ZTb.dealt={}
local bUb=pcall(gb.runRaw,YTb,jTb,ZTb)
local cUb={}
for dUb,eUb in pairs(type(tTb[uTb])==xre[2074]and tTb[uTb]or{})do
cUb[dUb]=eUb
end
if bUb then
local fUb,gUb={},0
for hUb,iUb in ipairs(jTb)do
if not iUb.farm and not fUb[iUb.id]then
local jUb=(tonumber(ZTb.dealt[V.name(iUb.id)])or 0)+(tonumber(ZTb.dealt[xre[2641]..iUb.id])or 0)
fUb[iUb.id]={e=iUb,d=jUb}
gUb=gUb+jUb
end
end
local kUb=0
for lUb,mUb in pairs(fUb)do
mUb.s=gUb>0 and mUb.d/gUb or 0
if mUb.s>=gb.UNIT_SHARE_MIN then
kUb=kUb+mUb.s*mUb.s
end
end
if kUb>0 then
local nUb={}
for oUb,pUb in pairs(fUb)do
if pUb.s>=gb.UNIT_SHARE_MIN then
local qUb=type(cUb[oUb])==xre[2074]and cUb[oUb]or nil
local rUb=qUb and tonumber(qUb.n)or 0
local sUb=rUb==0 and 1 or math.max(0.5,1/(rUb+1))
local tUb=(qUb and gb.ukNow(qUb,oUb))or gb.unitK(iTb,pUb.e,pTb)
local uUb=U.clamp(sUb*gb.UNIT_SPLIT*math.log(lTb)*pUb.s/kUb,-math.log(2),math.log(2))
local vUb=U.clamp(tUb*math.exp(uUb),gb.UNIT_MIN,gb.UNIT_MAX)
cUb[oUb]={k=vUb,nu=V.nudge(oUb),n=rUb+1,sn=qUb and tonumber(qUb.sn)or nil,at=os.time()}
table.insert(nUb,{s=pUb.s,t=string.format(xre[3791],V.name(oUb),vUb,pTb and xre[3792]or xre[3793],math.floor(pUb.s*100+0.5),tUb)})
end
end
table.sort(nUb,function(wUb,xUb)
return wUb.s>xUb.s
end)
for yUb,zUb in ipairs(nUb)do
table.insert(PTb,zUb.t)
end
end
end
tTb.dmgK,tTb[uTb]=vTb,cUb
gb._dmgAll=nil
return PTb
end
gb.SHARE_FLOOR,gb.SHARE_STEP=0.03,0.5
function gb.shareLearn()
if bb.withOthers or bb.joinedMid or bb.random or bb.trialId or bb.stopping or#game:GetService(xre[972]):GetPlayers()>1 then
return
end
local AUb=bb.info
if type(AUb)~=xre[2074]or type(bb.predUnits)~=xre[2074]or#bb.predUnits==0 or not bb.key then
return
end
local BUb=bb.damageShares()
if not BUb then
return
end
local CUb=gb.teamFrom(bb.predUnits,AUb.map)
local DUb={}
for EUb,FUb in pairs(bb.predOpt or{hpMul=1})do
DUb[EUb]=FUb
end
DUb.dealt={}
if not pcall(gb.runRaw,AUb,CUb,DUb)then
return
end
local GUb,HUb={},0
for IUb,JUb in ipairs(CUb)do
if not JUb.farm and not GUb[JUb.id]then
local KUb=(tonumber(DUb.dealt[V.name(JUb.id)])or 0)+(tonumber(DUb.dealt[xre[2641]..JUb.id])or 0)
GUb[JUb.id]={e=JUb,d=KUb}
HUb=HUb+KUb
end
end
if HUb<=0 then
return
end
local LUb=gb.cal(bb.key)
local MUb=bb.killZone()and true or false
local NUb=MUb and xre[3783]or xre[3782]
local OUb={}
for PUb,QUb in pairs(type(LUb[NUb])==xre[2074]and LUb[NUb]or{})do
OUb[PUb]=QUb
end
local RUb,SUb=0,0
for TUb,UUb in pairs(GUb)do
UUb.p,UUb.r=UUb.d/HUb,tonumber(BUb[TUb])or 0
if UUb.p>=gb.SHARE_FLOOR or UUb.r>=gb.SHARE_FLOOR then
local VUb=type(OUb[TUb])==xre[2074]and OUb[TUb]or nil
local WUb=VUb and tonumber(VUb.sn)or 0
UUb.step=U.clamp(gb.SHARE_STEP*math.max(0.5,1/(WUb+1))*math.log((UUb.r+gb.SHARE_FLOOR)/(UUb.p+gb.SHARE_FLOOR)),-math.log(2),math.log(2))
UUb.old,UUb.sn=VUb,WUb
RUb,SUb=RUb+UUb.step,SUb+1
end
end
if SUb<2 then
